  "description": "OpenTelemetry emit-side bridge for Tamp builds. Wraps openteleemetry-dotnet SDK setup as a one-call adopter surface — auto-registers Tamp.Core's existing ActivitySources (Tamp.Build, Tamp.Targets) + meters, configures OTLP/HTTP export with default resource attributes (service.name, host.*, ci.vendor). Bundle this once in Main and every Tamp build emits structured traces + metrics to your OTLP backend (Honeycomb / Grafana Tempo / tamp-beacon / any OTLP receiver).",
